<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="SNOW explanation workspace.">
  <title>SNOW Explanation</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./src/styles/main.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main class="explanation-shell">
    <header class="explanation-header">
      <a class="top-link" href="./index.html">Workspace</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span class="brand-accent brand-s">S</span>mart
        <span class="brand-accent brand-n">N</span>ote
        <span class="brand-accent brand-o">O</span>rganizer for
        <span class="brand-accent brand-w">W</span>eb
      </p>
      <h1>해설</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="explanation-board">
      <article class="panel explanation-panel">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <p class="panel-kicker">Question</p>
          <h2>문제</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="explanation-placeholder">선택한 문제 내용이 이 영역에 표시됩니다.</div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel explanation-panel">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <p class="panel-kicker">Answer</p>
          <h2>정답 및 해설</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="explanation-placeholder">정답, 풀이 과정, 참고 문서 근거를 배치할 영역입니다.</div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel explanation-panel">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <p class="panel-kicker">References</p>
          <h2>참고 섹션</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="explanation-placeholder">문서에서 인용한 섹션과 페이지 정보를 보여줄 영역입니다.</div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
